              <p>Over the past few weeks, Anthropic has dominated news cycles with the release of their Claude Cowork Plugins and Claude Code Plugins. These releases have sent shockwaves through the market, contributing to a massive software stock selloff (dubbed the "SaaSpocalypse") as investors fear AI agents will replace traditional SaaS interfaces.</p>
