              <p><strong>Objection 2:</strong> "Developers prefer Claude Code plugins." <br />
              <strong>Rebuttal:</strong> AgentKit ships with Evals, trace grading, and Codex app UI for secure multi-agent orchestration.</p>
              <p><strong>Objection 3:</strong> "MCP is the standard." <br />
              <strong>Rebuttal:</strong> OpenAI supports MCP but wraps it in Guardrails + Global Admin Console.</p>
              <h5 class="text-xs font-bold text-yellow-300 uppercase tracking-wide">🚀 The Bottom Line</h5>
