        <div class="bg-gray-900 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-1">Flagship Model Pricing</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mb-4">Output price per 1M tokens — log scale. Click bars to filter.</p>
